DELETE /2.0/collaboration_whitelist_exempt_targets/{collaboration_whitelist_exempt_target_id}
Removes a user's exemption from the restrictions set out by the allowed list of domains for collaborations.
Required: collaboration_whitelist_exempt_target_id (path) — The ID of the exemption to the list.

GET /2.0/collaboration_whitelist_exempt_targets/{collaboration_whitelist_exempt_target_id}
Returns a users who has been exempt from the collaboration domain restrictions.
Required: collaboration_whitelist_exempt_target_id (path) — The ID of the exemption to the list.
